WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.249
How does illegal money become

2
00:00:02.249 --> 00:00:04.725
clean? In three steps.

3
00:00:05.062 --> 00:00:06.847
Placement puts the cash into

4
00:00:06.847 --> 00:00:07.687
the system.

5
00:00:07.687 --> 00:00:09.620
