11
00:00:19.784 --> 00:00:22.971
2005. The Enforcement Directorate investigates

12
00:00:22.971 --> 00:00:24.154
under it.

13
00:00:24.471 --> 00:00:27.365
The Financial Action Task Force

14
00:00:27.365 --> 00:00:29.085
was set up by the

15
00:00:29.085 --> 00:00:30.473
G7 in 1989.

16
00:00:30.473 --> 00:00:32.827
India became a member in

17
00:00:32.827 --> 00:00:33.861
